<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia Mitol to be listed on OTC market.</title>
<headline>Slovenia Mitol to be listed on OTC market.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovenian glue and pitch producer Mitol will be listed on the over-the-counter market of the Ljubljana Stock Exchange on May 15, the bourse said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The company will list 419,359 shares with a nominal value of 1,000 tolars each, representing 54.4 percent of its equity. -- Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439 ($ = 157.6 Slovenian Tolars)</p>
</text>
